<http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/assertion> {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/EvidenceItem> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The frozen Aves exam roster (48 species) and the 12432 blind predictions made against it" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The exam file holdout/exam.json was frozen by the holdout thread before any prediction was made. Its SHA-256 recorded in holdout/CHECKSUMS.json is 06b797929a27fad5b7173dbaa0c2d9d297deea478a64b7a7935f85caec430360; recomputed at prediction time it was 06b797929a27fad5b7173dbaa0c2d9d297deea478a64b7a7935f85caec430360, and the two match. Roster size 48 species. The panel is 259 Uberon terms selected by this rule: Uberon terms in uberon_slim, organ_slim or major_organ with a never_in_taxon axiom or an in_taxon more specific than Vertebrata; grouping, non-informative and upper-level terms excluded. Predictions: 12432 rows in organism-design/exam/aves-predictions.json (SHA-256 8137187c684d182b493190ca6349c24cafe94ba933ff35437984be98887af041), one per species and panel structure, each carrying the species, the structure IRI, present or absent, whether the basis is stated or default, and the reason. Tally: 5283 absent, 5664 present with a stated basis, 1485 present by default. Inputs read: holdout/exam.json (identifiers only); holdout/CHECKSUMS.json; Ubergraph SPARQL endpoint (Uberon, NCBI Taxonomy). Inputs deliberately not read: AVONET; AnAge; EltonTraits; Amniote database; genomes; occurrence counts; any bird trait value." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "organism-design/exam/aves-predictions.json" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "sha256:8137187c684d182b493190ca6349c24cafe94ba933ff35437984be98887af041" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon.owl> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ubergraph.apps.renci.org/sparql> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/organism-aves-exam-and-predictions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi/blob/main/organism-design/exam/aves-predictions.json> .
}
